* ORDENQ:BR-007 [[ORDENQ:25]]
* Branch: CASE ORDVIEW.STATUS
* Scenario: test_ordenq_case_conf_calls_pricecalc
*
* Source lines 26-28 show WHEN "CONF" routes to CALL "PRICECALC"
