MOVE "CONF" TO #STATUS
MOVE "ORD00001" TO #ORDER-NO
MOVE 100.00 TO #ORDER-WT
* Stub: PRICECALC records that it was called with (#ORDER-NO, #ORDER-WT)
* ... invoke unit under test with ORDVIEW.STATUS = "CONF" ...
